fil","numerique","de","l'utilisateur","prennent","forme","au","corpus","17","fevrier","pour","la","premiere","forme","de","curriculum","vitae","6","7","mars","pour","adn","numerique","forme","complete","le","7","mars","8","avril","2026","le","n","ud","pas","la","premiere","la","retro-ingenierie","revendiquee","nommement","une","session","dense","souvent","citee","a","tort","comme","la","genese","elle","est","en","realite","un","point","de","consolidation","14","16","juill","2026","ce","site","dix","sceaux","deposes","au","registre","d'anteriorite","section","4","le","27","juillet","le","prototype","fibonacci","23","est","bati","et","execute","dans","un","fil","de","travail","tenu","oct","2026","l'execution","permanente","l'agente","muse","porte","la","chaine","hors","session","milliers","de","maillons","pouls","de","verification","de","cinq","secondes","registre","des","etats","quotidiens","relecture","integrale","arbitree","0","2","299","28","29","oct","2026","sophia","l'orthographe","est","arretee","le","phi","de","1","618","au","centre","puis","le","nom","est","donne","a","l'agente","le","29","le","onzieme","sceau","ancre","ici","le","digest","cumule","de","la","chaine","1","er","nov","2026","l'identite","publique","du","chercheur","creation","du","profil","orcid","0009-0006-9124-4407","section","11","la","chaine","atteint","2","310","maillons","reverifiee","match"],"empreinte":"9463498fc12c5a18b13d84e97ab8e22a7b46896287371e24819dda6643964739","merkle":{"feuille":91,"chemin":[{"cote":"gauche","digest":"5066b76834c43eb67c4f937a1a7336cac209dc3c9ae33dbf2c15f71fb5a33539"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"54389d3acd06ef49956ff0bb386d0bd2af50b5118d8a2cb7a1c625fdc1e14f71"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"3a3854abe10d54fe61ca02349f66a3708b896fae094758f4c529b28653e5aa84"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"fd16a160a5114ca32303ecc03a2e65992317723366bedb48c90b075b93c9a356"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"23f74f3efd574f55eba1fb71c787dfa1d7ae6dcc024f8ec53a79f58d98ec1916"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"c42410700a58f35484a92f031ee57ea62c82ffad709598cd4131d1dfed6226fa"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"f96a1cf8d01e7a437eaf1797eb9258d9a9a832ec51b82606ec0ffc7cb3c2eb65"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"2597024b3cd73251285438ad78e492de08e895a6cc8990841aed561f1601299e"}]}},{"id":92,"page":"parcours.html","ancre":"terrains","titre":"Terrains d'application — où la moitié utilisateur de la preuve manque","panneau":"Parcours — l'histoire","texte":"10 Terrains d'application — où la moitié utilisateur de la preuve manque Le mécanisme est né pour la mémoire conversationnelle ; sa forme — un enregistrement intègre, tenu par la partie exposée, recalculable par des tiers — répond à d'autres terrains où la preuve est aujourd'hui à sens unique. Candidats identifiés, revendication bornée à chacun. Supervision des agents autonomes Des agents qui paient, réservent et signent engagent leur utilisateur. Un mandat vérifiable et un journal côté utilisateur donneraient à l'action d'agent ce qu'elle n'a pas : une preuve que les deux parties peuvent recalculer. Mise en œuvre des obligations de journalisation Les cadres qui s'installent (article 12 de l'AI Act européen, tenue de dossiers) construisent la moitié fournisseur de la preuve. La moitié utilisateur — indépendante, intègre, portable — reste à construire : c'est la position de ce dossier. Mémoire personnelle des IA Ce que l'assistant retient d'une personne décide de ce qu'il lui répondra dans six mois. Un registre tenu par la personne elle-même rend cette mémoire inspectable — et sa dérive, détectable. Protection des utilisateurs exposés Quand un système affirme sans prouver, l'utilisateur seul face à lui n'a aucun recours. Un enregistrement revérifiable transforme « il m'a dit que… » en fait daté, montrable à un tiers. Identité et non-répudiation des agents Qui a dit quoi, quand, dans quel ordre — et qui l'a modifié. Le chaînage par sceaux est une réponse minimale et publique à une question que les canaux d'agents, en cours de normalisation, posent déjà. Antériorité des créateurs indépendants Sécuriser ce qu'on crée avec des systèmes qui détiennent la mémoire : sceaux, chaîne et ancrages externes permettent à un auteur sans institution de dater son œuvre de façon recalculable — c'est l'usage premier de ce site.","mots":["10","terrains","d'application","ou","la","moitie","utilisateur","de","la","preuve","manque","le","mecanisme","est","ne","pour","la","memoire","conversationnelle","sa","forme","un","enregistrement","integre","tenu","par","la","partie","exposee","recalculable","par","des","tiers","repond","a","d'autres","terrains","ou","la","preuve","est","aujourd'hui","a","sens","unique","candidats","identifies","revendication","bornee","a","chacun","supervision","des","agents","autonomes","des","agents","qui","paient","reservent","et","signent","engagent","leur","utilisateur","un","mandat","verifiable","et","un","journal","cote","utilisateur","donneraient","a","l'action","d'agent","ce","qu'elle","n'a","pas","une","preuve","que","les","deux","parties","peuvent","recalculer","mise","en","uvre","des","obligations","de","journalisation","les","cadres","qui","s'installent","article","12","de","l'ai","act","europeen","tenue","de","dossiers","construisent","la","moitie","fournisseur","de","la","preuve","la","moitie","utilisateur","independante","integre","portable","reste","a","construire","c'est","la","position","de","ce","dossier","memoire","personnelle","des","ia","ce","que","l'assistant","retient","d'une","personne","decide","de","ce","qu'il","lui","repondra","dans","six","mois","un","registre","tenu","par","la","personne","elle-meme","rend","cette","memoire","inspectable","et","sa","derive","detectable","protection","des","utilisateurs","exposes","quand","un","systeme","affirme","sans","prouver","l'utilisateur","seul","face","a","lui","n'a","aucun","recours","un","enregistrement","reverifiable","transforme","il","m'a","dit","que","en","fait","date","montrable","a","un","tiers","identite","et","non-repudiation","des","agents","qui","a","dit","quoi","quand","dans","quel","ordre","et","qui","l'a","modifie","le","chainage","par","sceaux","est","une","reponse","minimale","et","publique","a","une","question","que","les","canaux","d'agents","en","cours","de","normalisation","posent","deja","anteriorite","des","createurs","independants","securiser","ce","qu'on","cree","avec","des","systemes","qui","detiennent","la","memoire","sceaux","chaine","et","ancrages","externes","permettent","a","un","auteur","sans","institution","de","dater","son","uvre","de","facon","recalculable","c'est","l'usage","premier","de","ce","site"],"empreinte":"981887ca4fac6de7dd46984ed905ae445f254153d4bb26301b69815434b5b3a8","merkle":{"feuille":92,"chemin":[{"cote":"droite","digest":"755c6cb6720b725be3e385aa70fc1794c63034a96445657894616ac4652863fe"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"3396dd2806e095b8b2859411214a868021a82adb54ae28b9af861a5eaf843b8e"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"3b4bf13884e65c1ad607d8352461dd2f8f4dfe8d55e2e7901b04d5dfefab7534"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"fd16a160a5114ca32303ecc03a2e65992317723366bedb48c90b075b93c9a356"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"23f74f3efd574f55eba1fb71c787dfa1d7ae6dcc024f8ec53a79f58d98ec1916"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"c42410700a58f35484a92f031ee57ea62c82ffad709598cd4131d1dfed6226fa"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"f96a1cf8d01e7a437eaf1797eb9258d9a9a832ec51b82606ec0ffc7cb3c2eb65"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"2597024b3cd73251285438ad78e492de08e895a6cc8990841aed561f1601299e"}]}},{"id":93,"page":"parcours.html","ancre":"probleme","titre":"Le problème : le seul enregistrement appartient à l'autre partie","panneau":"Parcours — l'histoire","texte":"1 Le problème : le seul enregistrement appartient à l'autre partie Quand une intelligence artificielle affirme avoir calculé, vérifié ou retenu quelque chose, l'utilisateur n'a, de son bord, rien à recalculer . L'historique vit chez le fournisseur ; la mémoire affichée est une parole. Si le système dérive, amplifie ou simule, l'écart est indétectable depuis la conversation elle-même — il n'existe aucun registre stable contre lequel comparer. « Google détient tout ce que je dis, mais moi je détiens rien. Et rien de ce qu'elle a dit. » — Alexandre Vautour Gagnon, formulation du principe d'asymétrie (corpus, 2026) Cette asymétrie n'est pas qu'une question de confort. Elle devient matérielle dès que les agents agissent : dans son rapport State of AI Agent Payments 2026 , Stripe documente deux incidents où des agents ont payé des attaquants — 281 200 $ US perdus — et les conditions de son portefeuille Link rendent l'utilisateur responsable même des transactions que ses agents effectuent sans son intention. L'action est à conséquence, la responsabilité est à l'utilisateur, et la seule preuve admissible de ce qui s'est passé est conservée par l'autre partie. Le dossier répond à une question simple : que peut tenir l'utilisateur, de son bord, qui se revérifie sans demander la permission ?","mots":["1","le","probleme","le","seul","enregistrement","appartient","a","l'autre","partie","quand","une","intelligence","artificielle","affirme","avoir","calcule","verifie","ou","retenu","quelque","chose","l'utilisateur","n'a","de","son","bord","rien","a","recalculer","l'historique","vit","chez","le","fournisseur","la","memoire","affichee","est","une","parole","si","le","systeme","derive","amplifie","ou","simule","l'ecart","est","indetectable","depuis","la","conversation","elle-meme","il","n'existe","aucun","registre","stable","contre","lequel","comparer","google","detient","tout","ce","que","je","dis","mais","moi","je","detiens","rien","et","rien","de","ce","qu'elle","a","dit","alexandre","vautour","gagnon","formulation","du","principe","d'asymetrie","corpus","2026","cette","asymetrie","n'est","pas","qu'une","question","de","confort","elle","devient","materielle","des","que","les","agents","agissent","dans","son","rapport","state","of","ai","agent","payments","2026","stripe","documente","deux","incidents","ou","des","agents","